  #cols[3. $cs(x/2+y/3-z=4 dou, x/3-y/2+z/2=3 dou, x/2-y/3-z/4=3 ju)$][4. $cs(2x-7y=-10 dou, 9y+4z=18 dou, 11x+8z=-19 ju)$]
